This is a placeholder for the Diamond Locker Management System Desktop Installer.
To compile the real installer:
1. Run "npm install -D electron-builder" in the root directory.
2. Configure build parameters in package.json.
3. Run "npx electron-builder build --win --portable".
4. Copy the resulting .exe file from the dist-electron/ folder to this path (backend/storage/uploads/DiamondLockerSetup.exe).
